t=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cf137a854f21acbc58eec04095a5ae39", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/60d48f02/uploads/origins/a89c87b0-1a42-4fe6-89b2-f9aa49f8a066?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cf137a854f21acbc58eec04095a5ae39, https://si.imgix.net/60d48f02/uploads/origins/a89c87b0-1a42-4fe6-89b2-f9aa49f8a066?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f1aab07f748daabcd905d066b2c05e40 2x, https://si.imgix.net/60d48f02/uploads/origins/a89c87b0-1a42-4fe6-89b2-f9aa49f8a066?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7f7221d56cf7407571374b9ea3f26fa5 3x", "genre": "comic", "nsfw": false, "body": "この前の琴葉姉妹のイラストがとても良かったので、足の裏をくすぐり合う琴葉姉妹をお願いしたいです！\n足裏を指でなぞったりくすぐったりして笑うのを我慢→爆笑の流れがあると嬉しいです！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yuzu_gin/works/32", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/995c5852/uploads/origins/51be2f47-78ea-4112-b730-f4550a72e188?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0b4edab48792ff48183c801bdd7254fd", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/995c5852/uploads/origins/51be2f47-78ea-4112-b730-f4550a72e188?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0b4edab48792ff48183c801bdd7254fd, https://si.imgix.net/995c5852/uploads/origins/51be2f47-78ea-4112-b730-f4550a72e188?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b3026f8e56269ef566b6bb0228ad3119 2x, https://si.imgix.net/995c5852/uploads/origins/51be2f47-78ea-4112-b730-f4550a72e188?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fd22516ec92d2168e301764c7440d594 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "私のキャラクター、アリフを描いてください。どんなポーズでもいいんだけど、靴下は履いてないほうがいいな。\n\nよろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1p2pfw0yulEVbGRoGy0xZ2cKIAEv9VcHJ?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yuzu_gin/works/31", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.